OL,3,GNEWSAResidents say 'nobody cares' over
OL,4,Afly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousing estate residents say they have
OL,7,Fbeen overwhelmed with incidents of
OL,8,Ffly-tipping.
OL,10,FThere are currently three large piles
OL,11,Fof waste within 100 yards of each other
OL,12,Fon Inns Court Drive in the Knowle West
OL,13,Farea of Bristol.
OL,15,FPeople living locally say they are
OL,16,Fadding to one of the piles with waste
OL,17,Fthey have found dumped in the
OL,18,Fsurrounding area in the hope it will
OL,19,Fget collected - but say it has now been
OL,20,Fthere for months.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
