OL,3,GNEWSAResidents say 'nobody cares' over
OL,4,Afly-tipping
OL,5,
OL,6,FBristol City Council acknowledged there
OL,7,Fhad been longstanding waste issues in
OL,8,Fthe area and discouraged locals from
OL,9,Fhandling fly-tipped material, while
OL,10,Fthanking them for trying to improve the
OL,11,Farea.
